{"1":{"w":[{"c":"عَبَسَ","d":"ʿabasa","e":"He frowned"},{"c":"وَتَوَلَّى","d":"watawallā","e":"and turned away"}],"a":{"g":"The Prophet frowned and turned away"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"Because"},{"c":"جَاءَهُ","d":"jāahu","e":"came to him"},{"c":"الْأَعْمَى","d":"l-aʿmā","e":"the blind man"}],"a":{"g":"Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting]."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"But what"},{"c":"يُدْرِيكَ","d":"yud'rīka","e":"would make you know"},{"c":"لَعَلَّهُ","d":"laʿallahu","e":"that he might"},{"c":"يَزَّكَّى","d":"yazzakkā","e":"purify himself"}],"a":{"g":"But what would make you perceive, [O Muhammad], that perhaps he might be purified"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"Or"},{"c":"يَذَّكَّرُ","d":"yadhakkaru","e":"be reminded"},{"c":"فَتَنْفَعَهُ","d":"fatanfaʿahu","e":"so would benefit him"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَى","d":"l-dhik'rā","e":"the reminder"}],"a":{"g":"Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"أَمَّا","d":"ammā","e":"As for"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"اسْتَغْنَى","d":"is'taghnā","e":"considers himself free from need"}],"a":{"g":"As for he who thinks himself without need,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَنْتَ","d":"fa-anta","e":"So you"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to him"},{"c":"تَصَدَّى","d":"taṣaddā","e":"give attention"}],"a":{"g":"To him you give attention."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"عَلَيْكَ","d":"ʿalayka","e":"upon you"},{"c":"أَلَّا","d":"allā","e":"that not"},{"c":"يَزَّكَّى","d":"yazzakkā","e":"he purifies himself"}],"a":{"g":"And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(he) who"},{"c":"جَاءَكَ","d":"jāaka","e":"came to you"},{"c":"يَسْعَى","d":"yasʿā","e":"striving"}],"a":{"g":"But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"While he"},{"c":"يَخْشَى","d":"yakhshā","e":"fears"}],"a":{"g":"While he fears [Allah],"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَنْتَ","d":"fa-anta","e":"But you"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"from him"},{"c":"تَلَهَّى","d":"talahhā","e":"(are) distracted"}],"a":{"g":"From him you are distracted."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"إِنَّهَا","d":"innahā","e":"Indeed it"},{"c":"تَذْكِرَةٌ","d":"tadhkiratun","e":"(is) a reminder"}],"a":{"g":"No! Indeed, these verses are a reminder;"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"So whosoever"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"wills"},{"c":"ذَكَرَهُ","d":"dhakarahu","e":"may remember it"}],"a":{"g":"So whoever wills may remember it."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"صُحُفٍ","d":"ṣuḥufin","e":"sheets"},{"c":"مُكَرَّمَةٍ","d":"mukarramatin","e":"honored"}],"a":{"g":"[It is recorded] in honored sheets,"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"مَرْفُوعَةٍ","d":"marfūʿatin","e":"Exalted"},{"c":"مُطَهَّرَةٍ","d":"muṭahharatin","e":"purified"}],"a":{"g":"Exalted and purified,"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"بِأَيْدِي","d":"bi-aydī","e":"In (the) hands"},{"c":"سَفَرَةٍ","d":"safaratin","e":"(of) scribes"}],"a":{"g":"[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"كِرَامٍ","d":"kirāmin","e":"Noble"},{"c":"بَرَرَةٍ","d":"bararatin","e":"dutiful"}],"a":{"g":"Noble and dutiful."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"قُتِلَ","d":"qutila","e":"Is destroyed"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"the man"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"how"},{"c":"أَكْفَرَهُ","d":"akfarahu","e":"ungrateful is he!"}],"a":{"g":"Cursed is man; how disbelieving is he."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"From"},{"c":"أَيِّ","d":"ayyi","e":"what"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"خَلَقَهُ","d":"khalaqahu","e":"He created him"}],"a":{"g":"From what substance did He create him?"}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"From"},{"c":"نُطْفَةٍ","d":"nuṭ'fatin","e":"a sperm drop"},{"c":"خَلَقَهُ","d":"khalaqahu","e":"He created him"},{"c":"فَقَدَّرَهُ","d":"faqaddarahu","e":"then He proportioned him"}],"a":{"g":"From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"السَّبِيلَ","d":"l-sabīla","e":"the way"},{"c":"يَسَّرَهُ","d":"yassarahu","e":"He made easy for him"}],"a":{"g":"Then He eased the way for him;"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"أَمَاتَهُ","d":"amātahu","e":"He causes him to die"},{"c":"فَأَقْبَرَهُ","d":"fa-aqbarahu","e":"and provides a grave for him"}],"a":{"g":"Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"He wills"},{"c":"أَنْشَرَهُ","d":"ansharahu","e":"He will resurrect him"}],"a":{"g":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect him."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَقْضِ","d":"yaqḍi","e":"he has accomplished"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"أَمَرَهُ","d":"amarahu","e":"He commanded him"}],"a":{"g":"No! Man has not yet accomplished what He commanded him."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"فَلْيَنْظُرِ","d":"falyanẓuri","e":"Then let look"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"the man"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"at"},{"c":"طَعَامِهِ","d":"ṭaʿāmihi","e":"his food"}],"a":{"g":"Then let mankind look at his food -"}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"أَنَّا","d":"annā","e":"We"},{"c":"صَبَبْنَا","d":"ṣababnā","e":"[We] poured down"},{"c":"الْمَاءَ","d":"l-māa","e":"the water"},{"c":"صَبًّا","d":"ṣabban","e":"(in) abundance"}],"a":{"g":"How We poured down water in torrents,"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"شَقَقْنَا","d":"shaqaqnā","e":"We cleaved"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"شَقًّا","d":"shaqqan","e":"splitting"}],"a":{"g":"Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَنْبَتْنَا","d":"fa-anbatnā","e":"Then We caused to grow"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"حَبًّا","d":"ḥabban","e":"grain"}],"a":{"g":"And caused to grow within it grain"}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَعِنَبًا","d":"waʿinaban","e":"And grapes"},{"c":"وَقَضْبًا","d":"waqaḍban","e":"and green vegetables"}],"a":{"g":"And grapes and herbage"}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"وَزَيْتُونًا","d":"wazaytūnan","e":"And olive"},{"c":"وَنَخْلًا","d":"wanakhlan","e":"and date-palms"}],"a":{"g":"And olive and palm trees"}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَحَدَائِقَ","d":"waḥadāiqa","e":"And gardens"},{"c":"غُلْبًا","d":"ghul'ban","e":"(of) thick foliage"}],"a":{"g":"And gardens of dense shrubbery"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"وَفَاكِهَةً","d":"wafākihatan","e":"And fruits"},{"c":"وَأَبًّا","d":"wa-abban","e":"and grass"}],"a":{"g":"And fruit and grass -"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"مَتَاعًا","d":"matāʿan","e":"(As) a provision"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"وَلِأَنْعَامِكُمْ","d":"wali-anʿāmikum","e":"and for your cattle"}],"a":{"g":"[As] enjoyment for you and your grazing livestock."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"But when"},{"c":"جَاءَتِ","d":"jāati","e":"comes"},{"c":"الصَّاخَّةُ","d":"l-ṣākhatu","e":"the Deafening Blast"}],"a":{"g":"But when there comes the Deafening Blast"}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَفِرُّ","d":"yafirru","e":"will flee"},{"c":"الْمَرْءُ","d":"l-maru","e":"a man"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَخِيهِ","d":"akhīhi","e":"his brother"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day a man will flee from his brother"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"وَأُمِّهِ","d":"wa-ummihi","e":"And his mother"},{"c":"وَأَبِيهِ","d":"wa-abīhi","e":"and his father"}],"a":{"g":"And his mother and his father"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَصَاحِبَتِهِ","d":"waṣāḥibatihi","e":"And his wife"},{"c":"وَبَنِيهِ","d":"wabanīhi","e":"and his children"}],"a":{"g":"And his wife and his children,"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"لِكُلِّ","d":"likulli","e":"For every"},{"c":"امْرِئٍ","d":"im'ri-in","e":"man"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"شَأْنٌ","d":"shanun","e":"(will be) a matter"},{"c":"يُغْنِيهِ","d":"yugh'nīhi","e":"occupying him"}],"a":{"g":"For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وُجُوهٌ","d":"wujūhun","e":"Faces"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"مُسْفِرَةٌ","d":"mus'firatun","e":"(will be) bright"}],"a":{"g":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"ضَاحِكَةٌ","d":"ḍāḥikatun","e":"Laughing"},{"c":"مُسْتَبْشِرَةٌ","d":"mus'tabshiratun","e":"rejoicing at good news"}],"a":{"g":"Laughing, rejoicing at good news."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَوُجُوهٌ","d":"wawujūhun","e":"And faces"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"عَلَيْهَا","d":"ʿalayhā","e":"upon them"},{"c":"غَبَرَةٌ","d":"ghabaratun","e":"(will be) dust"}],"a":{"g":"And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"تَرْهَقُهَا","d":"tarhaquhā","e":"Will cover them"},{"c":"قَتَرَةٌ","d":"qataratun","e":"darkness"}],"a":{"g":"Blackness will cover them."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"Those"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"[they]"},{"c":"الْكَفَرَةُ","d":"l-kafaratu","e":"(are) the disbelievers"},{"c":"الْفَجَرَةُ","d":"l-fajaratu","e":"the wicked ones"}],"a":{"g":"Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones."}}}